diff --git a/AGENTS.md b/AGENTS.md
index 7765fed..74eb16a 100644
--- a/AGENTS.md
+++ b/AGENTS.md
@@ -56,6 +56,10 @@ Database-backed job queue (no Redis):
 
 Recurring tasks are declared in `config/recurring.yml`.
 
+### Notifications and Web Push
+
+Notifiers (`app/models/notifier/`) create one `Notification` per user and card, which lands in the tray and gets bundled into emails. Every time a notification gets a new source, `Notification::Pushing` also sends it to the user's `Push::Subscription`s (one per browser they turned on from notification settings) via `Notification::PushJob`, rendering `notifications/push.json.jbuilder` so a push says what the tray says. Pushes are signed with the VAPID key pair from `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY`/`VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY` (`Push.enabled?`); the service worker in `app/views/pwa/service_worker.js.erb` shows them and opens the card.
+
 ### Sharded Full-Text Search
 
 Full-text search runs in the database, not Elasticsearch. On MySQL it is sharded 16 ways by CRC32 of the account ID (`Search::Record::Trilogy`); on SQLite it is a single FTS5 index (`Search::Record::SQLite`). Don't assume the sharded shape when working under SQLite. Models in `app/models/search/`.
