diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 6bddff1..ae3c8e1 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,31 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Turns on push notifications for the browser making the request: whatever lands in the user's notifications tray is also pushed to it. Pass the subscription the browser got from its push service; `:user_id` must be the current user. Registering the same subscription again is a no-op.
+
+Pushes are signed with the instance's VAPID key pair, whose public key the browser needs when subscribing. Without a key pair configured, this endpoint isn't offered in the web app.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `push_subscription[endpoint]` | string | Yes | The push service URL for this browser |
+| `push_subscription[p256dh_key]` | string | Yes | The browser's public key, base64url-encoded |
+| `push_subscription[auth_key]` | string | Yes | The browser's authentication secret, base64url-encoded |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/dpH5lCsTSSM:APA91bH…",
+    "p256dh_key": "BNcRdreALRFXTkOOUHK1EtK2wtaz5Ry4YfYCA_0QTpQtUbVlUls0VJXg7A8u-Ts1XbjhazAkj7I99e8QcYP7DkM=",
